.TH "GRAPH COMMAND"
The graph command displays information about chains or tycoons in a
graphic manner.
.s3
The command:
.EX "graph chains"
will display the price per share for each stock both before and after
each update so far.
.s3
The command:
.EX "graph tycoons"
will display the net worth for each tycoon both before and after
each update so far.
.s3
